[{:db/id "q-105297/selection/7f3df5528491218f6c43ca4706037b85879a5d4e6d53e3e4000d714fe940d8bc" :answer/id #uuid "0a718aa7-f0f1-5f71-b30d-7e4ae8b12749" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ -10 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105297/selection/caab42f0caeaf967e6136bf4bb2499811b17cf8fafd0863a6a85699c784216b3" :answer/id #uuid "189a97c4-f995-5360-adf5-035578de3022" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ -2 \\\\ -10\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105297/selection/fd1f2d1beda08738ec9b9271b69eea2f467c9e4eac70c5023e9e0cd14427a757" :answer/id #uuid "f3496373-ca93-53be-9c36-de3d355e1589" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-10 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105297/selection/b7c7fcc2e9ef2762169b46ee048e79087a0a56bdfaa81ee4197f873220c8c5eb" :answer/id #uuid "8b482bc5-2c52-5dfc-990c-579a8900fd64" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}10 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105297/selection/eeeb2698b9ca5ed69b1f2bbc9f2dc6c637ad7482f7b19d1395648bbc66fd9fcc" :answer/id #uuid "6713df6d-3946-5c92-bed3-a53566377647" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-10 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105297/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "e0714d41-23bd-5117-806a-603b643f122e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-105297/selection/eeeb2698b9ca5ed69b1f2bbc9f2dc6c637ad7482f7b19d1395648bbc66fd9fcc" :answer-field/choices ["q-105297/selection/7f3df5528491218f6c43ca4706037b85879a5d4e6d53e3e4000d714fe940d8bc" "q-105297/selection/caab42f0caeaf967e6136bf4bb2499811b17cf8fafd0863a6a85699c784216b3" "q-105297/selection/fd1f2d1beda08738ec9b9271b69eea2f467c9e4eac70c5023e9e0cd14427a757" "q-105297/selection/b7c7fcc2e9ef2762169b46ee048e79087a0a56bdfaa81ee4197f873220c8c5eb" "q-105297/selection/eeeb2698b9ca5ed69b1f2bbc9f2dc6c637ad7482f7b19d1395648bbc66fd9fcc"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-105297" :question/id #uuid "582f634c-02c7-58e7-9850-c7663e72a87b" :question/math-academy-id "q-105297" :question/problem "The set ${{a}_{1},{a}_{2}}$ is linearly dependent. Which of the following vectors could be ${a}_{2}$ if\n${a}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]?$" :question/worked-solution "We say that two vectors ${v}_{1}$ and ${v}_{2}$ are *linearly independent* if the only solution to the equation\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{v}_{1}+{x}_{2}{v}_{2}=0\n$$\n\nis ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=0.$ Otherwise, the vectors are *linearly dependent*.\n\nA set containing *only two* vectors is linearly *dependent* if and only if the two vectors are parallel.\n\nFrom the given options, the correct answer is \n\n$$\n{a}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}-10 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTo see why, notice that \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-10 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]=(-2)[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]=-2{a}_{1}.\n$$\n\nThis way, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{a}_{1}-2{a}_{1} & =0 \\\\ 2{a}_{1}+{a}_{2} & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn other words, the vectors ${a}_{1}$ and ${a}_{2}$ are parallel.\n\nTo see why this means that ${a}_{1}$ and ${a}_{2}$ are linearly dependent, we notice that the equation\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=0\n$$\n\nhas the solution ${x}_{1}=2$ and ${x}_{2}=1,$ which is different from ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}=0.$ Therefore, the set is linearly dependent." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-105297/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5130f54d-2a53-5373-81a6-355921ea7523"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-105297"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-34271/selection/291086c376d5ebef1e81b9196b4c4539a2dc4d27e2b17a735abf56d663088b99" :answer/id #uuid "40236b2e-fa08-5071-99d2-4a8c1ed178a8" 